      <div style="flex:1 1 300px; min-width:280px">
        <p class="vb-note"><b>Screen one</b> is the whole answer: brand + rose, headline, search pinned high, cluster chips, and the first two cards of the active cluster. No canvas cost beyond the small rose; the hex field is a CSS texture here. <b>Screen two</b> is one swipe: the dated list, the three doors, and the compact mission. The bottom bar persists everywhere with Search in the center slot; it replaces the hamburger on phones and is the chrome decision this comp carries into the build.</p>
