          <div class="vh-kbd"><span>↑↓ move</span><span>↵ go</span><span>esc close</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="vb-cellnote">Nothing typed yet, and it is already useful: clusters, doors, and the newest work. The visitor who does not know what to search never faces a blank box.</p>
